---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">STUDENT-MADE / UNOFFICIAL</p>
    <h1>
      A course companion,
      <br />
      built in class.
    </h1>
    <p class="lede">
      atlas was built while Jovan was taking these courses so the material,
      mistakes, schedules and connections could become useful to other students.
    </p>
    <p>
      A class has more structure than a folder of notes can show. Each idea
      depends on something, leads somewhere, and has a few places where the
      reasoning can go wrong. atlas makes those connections visible and gives
      you a way to test them.
    </p>
    <p>
      Guest progress stays on your device. The optional sync service helps carry
      it to other devices. Course content and original practice keep working
      when that service is unavailable.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is student-made and unofficial. atlas is not affiliated with the
      school, district or teachers. Verify important deadlines with teacher
      sources and report errors through Help.
    </p>
    <p>
      Designed & built by Jovan Pahal.{' '}
      <a href="https://github.com/jlsp124/atlas">View the repository ↗</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
